{"version":1,"content":"<p>德國企業級Linux發行版供應商SUSE計劃在全球範圍內裁減約10%的員工，預計涉及約190人。公司行政總裁Dirk-Peter van Leeuwen在發給全體員工的內部備忘錄中表示，人工智能和自動化技術正在從根本上改變軟件行業的工作方式，企業現有的組織架構和人員配置已經難以適應未來的發展要求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584862.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:56.532850+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:15:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.136653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.136653+00:00","content_hash":"fa5580584e63baa07ec8db050e322605f44b919863f7f355f811ca354a8b99d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}